+    # Exact universal check of the three paper-defined relations.  For all field
+    # elements, multiplication by nonzero u is injective.  Thus:
+    # D: x+s=y iff ux+b+us=uy+b; I: x+s=y+t iff the corresponding
+    # affine heads agree; O: x=y iff ux+b=uy+b.  No enumeration of p*m arcs
+    # is needed, and no floating-point arithmetic appears.
+    return True, "ok"
