/tmp/arxiv2302.13657.t6eoSC/src/arxiv.tex:890:In this section, we construct a right adjoint to the central Pultr functor defined by a $(\sigma, \tau)$-Pultr template for which $\rel P = \relcheck S_1$, for some choice of $\sigma$-symbol $\check S$, i.e., $\rel P$ is an $\check S$-edge.
