/tmp/arxiv2302.13657.t6eoSC/src/arxiv.tex:1237:As in the case of Lemma~\ref{lem:A-hard-pre}, the first lemma provides the adjunction in the special case $\rel A = \relT t$ for $t\in \trees$, and we derive the general case, which is covered by the second lemma, using the special case.
