codex
A final domain-essentiality audit exposed one weakness in the inherited design: because the answer syntax already forced an induced vertex map, the paper’s extra `D/I/O` relations imposed no additional constraint. I’m strengthening the witness to a general six-coefficient affine map on arc coordinates. The checker will use the arc relations to force that map down to the induced form, making Section 6.2 genuinely load-bearing while preserving the same planted construction and compact sum invariant.
apply patch
